---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Cookie Policy"
  updated="September 2026"
  description="How Compliance Navigator uses cookies and local storage. Short version: no tracking cookies."
>
  <p>
    Short version: Compliance Navigator does not use tracking or advertising
    cookies.
  </p>

  <h2>Essential storage</h2>
  <p>
    Browsing the site does not require cookies. We do not set cookies to identify
    or track you across sites.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party requests</h2>
  <p>
    We load web fonts from Google Fonts, which are delivered from Google's
    servers. This is used only to display the site's typography.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    If we introduce analytics in the future, we intend to use a privacy-friendly,
    cookieless approach and will describe it here before enabling it.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy as the product evolves. Material changes will be
    reflected by the "last updated" date above.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions? Reach us at
    <a href="mailto:privacy@wyzer.io">privacy@wyzer.io</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
